;    8: TDecorate(count=32, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=51, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ふん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=31, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=10, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ゆりこ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=かじ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=そそのか, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   17: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ほお, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   18: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=こんしん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   19: TDecorate(count=39, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=48, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   20: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=48, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   21: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=と, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=8991, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=8218, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\共有殺人.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―I attended the thirteenth-year memorial service, as planned.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could not see the residents' expressions, so I could not tell what they were thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After this, everything will be decided.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everything...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集集会所.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When the thirteenth-year memorial service was over, everyone left the meeting hall at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At an ordinary memorial service, no one would go home right away like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
People would stretch out legs tired from kneeling and talk in whispers, and the mood would be a little more relaxed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But today is different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What everyone means to do, leaving here so quickly―
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
I know.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Everyone will surely head for the settlement's exit, that is, the Arata mountain road.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then they will use Droga and capture <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Normally, surrounding the Niimura main house would be the better move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But in that circular notice I wrote 'lie in wait on the Arata mountain road.'<PG>
That is because Shirozaki-san is here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shirozaki-san handed <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> the cherry branch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So he should end up on the side protecting <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He will probably find some way to warn of the danger in advance.<PG>
Then <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> and the others are bound to try to escape from here at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unless they are <STYLE ID="2">Chigaya</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>, they will travel by car, which means by the Arata mountain road.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動車エンジン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
Just then, I saw <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-chan's</STYLE> car pull out of the Niimura main house toward the Arata mountain road.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Good. Just as I expected, it seems <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> and the others are trying to escape by car.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "2" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"I'm home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! Where have you been all this time!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh? I went to lay flowers for </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Wait, did something happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"It seems everyone's about to attack </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I'm relieved. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> weren't part of the attack."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"O-of course not! What should we do...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">You'd</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> be no use even if you went. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> are guarding them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"R-right... If those two are with them... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But will </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and the others be all right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Well, all we can do is trust them."</STYLE><PG>
So my daughters are with them too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even I have no intention of forcing this plan through at the cost of sacrificing my daughters.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Can the two of them really stay unharmed against everyone on Droga?<PG>
But however much I worry, everyone is already on the move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Trusting that <STYLE ID="2">Chigaya</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> will come through safe, I should make my next move.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Damn it! I'm going too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! Wait!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I ignored <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> trying to stop me and dashed out of the house.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I headed for the Arata mountain road.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at the right moment, I mean to stop and head back toward <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I do not know whether <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> has a grasp of this situation, but to be ready for when <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> is caught, back to <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> once more―<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">"............!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Someone was standing there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wearing neither red robes nor a Noh mask, and not taking part in capturing <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There is only one person like that.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-kun</STYLE>, do you know where everyone's gone?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This feeling―Shirozaki-san is waiting for me to slip up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"It seems everyone's trying to catch </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see. So the circular notice reached <STYLE ID="5">your</STYLE> place too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"The circular notice...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh? <STYLE ID="5">You</STYLE> don't know?
{PAUSE ""}
　This morning a circular came around saying to capture <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, though."<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"No, at least I haven't..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm... 
{PAUSE ""}
That circular said 'pass it to the house to the south.' 
{PAUSE ""}
The only house north of mine is the Niimura main house. 
{PAUSE ""}
Which means whoever made the circular delivered it to my house first."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"You're right. Well, all I'm saying is that I, at least, haven't seen it. Someone else in the Niimura household may have."</STYLE><PG>
"Hm? So you're saying <STYLE ID="6">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> passed it to my house?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Surely not. Those two would never do something like that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, maybe? She saw it, didn't get what it meant, and left it at my place."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I really doubt that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Probably not."<PG>
"In that case, it was <STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE> who made the circular after all?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Well, I can't blame you for thinking so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But please remember. Until now I was suspected as the curse-killing culprit, and even watched in the meeting hall. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">And yet the curse-killing happened. Don't you think this time is similar?"</STYLE><PG>
"So <STYLE ID="5">you're</STYLE> claiming innocence."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Of course. But </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you're quite brave. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">You knew about the circular notice and didn't join the capture. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">If the capture succeeds, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">you'll</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> be ostracized by the whole village, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I expect so."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Is that all right with you? Like that..."</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, a witch? Ridiculous. 
{PAUSE ""}
First they watch <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-kun</STYLE> over the murders, next it's <STYLE ID="7">Sakura-chan's</STYLE> curse?
{PAUSE ""}
　And now a high school girl from Motoki-cho is the culprit?
{PAUSE ""}
　The guesses keep changing and nothing gets solved. It's too absurd. 
{PAUSE ""}
Is this settlement nothing but fools?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's how hard a case it is."</STYLE><PG>
"When I was watching <STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE>, I said something, didn't I?
{PAUSE ""}
　That for <STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE> to be innocent, a curse-killing had to happen while <STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE> were under watch. 
{PAUSE ""}
In other words, <STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE> proved your innocence with a resident's life."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Well... if you put it that way, there's nothing more I can say, but..."</STYLE><PG>
"If someone other than <STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE> had proposed the watch, I'd understand. 
{PAUSE ""}
But the one who said to watch you was <STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE> yourself. That sticks with me, no matter what. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">You</STYLE> know the real culprit, don't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Please don't joke about that..."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
"Then tell me about last night, in detail."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Last night?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="5">You</STYLE> said it, didn't you? That you'd tell me the truth of the curse-killing case. 
{PAUSE ""}
On my way back from bringing <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> the cherry branch."<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
What is he talking about?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yesterday I went in the buggy to pick up the Motoki-cho group at the landslide.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shirozaki-san came along with me then, but I have not seen him since.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is he trying to bait me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, if there is one possibility...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It is <STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The dead <STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE> <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="ふん">posed</STYLE> as me and approached Shirozaki-san.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Most likely <STYLE ID="11">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> saw Shirozaki-san as a danger and tried to win him over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But Shirozaki-san must have grown suspicious for some reason and refused.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I say here that I "don't know" about last night, he will know that a dead man is up and about.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"That's right... I did say that. That I'd tell you the truth."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then tell me one more thing. 
{PAUSE ""}
Why did you say a curse-killing would happen today?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That was..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE>, what on earth did you say...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"That was... I'm sorry, I only said it out of a misunderstanding of my own. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">So I still don't clearly know why a curse-killing would happen today..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A very convenient misunderstanding. 
{PAUSE ""}
But since you said you'd tell the truth, misunderstanding or not, I'd like to hear your reasoning."<PG>
How much should I tell him?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even by mistake, I cannot say that <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE> are walking around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
