<STYLE ID="7">You'll be with me from now on, always."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"What do you mean...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">That makes three divine messengers. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">One more―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">all we need is a living first generation."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"So it's... me, as a divine messenger..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\死月編\裏\サクラ暗い.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="7">"Oh my, wasn't that your intention from the start?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\死月編\裏\サクラ半閉じ暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　If you don't want to, that's fine, you know? I just have to </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="そそのか">egg on</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> some other resident who used Droga."</STYLE><PG>
This is no longer... the <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> I know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew... I knew it was <STYLE ID="11">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s trap...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew the day would come when it would end like this...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I only... I only wanted to be with <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE>...<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> and the others will be here soon, you know? Hurry and lead everyone here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"By 'everyone,' you mean...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> or anyone will do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> precious person gets their life spared, and in exchange, we have </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> become a divine messenger. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Simple, isn't it?"</STYLE><PG>
I am no longer even allowed to act on my own will.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can only do as <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE>―no, as <STYLE ID="11">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> says.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Resisting here would mean nothing at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One faint hope: I become a divine messenger, and with <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE>, forever...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Now I have no choice but to cling to a hope as illusory as that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know that myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am a fool. A clown out of a comic monologue.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I can do is curse my own foolishness.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
