{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―When I went outside, 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> was standing outside the cave.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, why are you here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"In case everyone comes back. Here we can hide them all, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"That's right, like with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Chigaya</STYLE> was locked up here 10 years ago, in the grip of that murderous urge.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This secret base is also a hiding place for emergencies.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, deep down underground there should be a hidden passage leading to Mount Itohime. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If it comes to it, get everyone out through there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Deeper in...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Got it. When everyone arrives I'll take them deeper in for now, and if it still gets dangerous, we flee into the hidden passage, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"But it caves in easily, so be careful, you hear?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
At the same time, I recalled what Shirozaki-san had said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The culprit who cut off <STYLE ID="7">Sakura's</STYLE> head 10 years ago―that may be <STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And could it be that <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> saw it happen and has confused me with <STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since it has come to this, maybe I should find out.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ten years ago... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Sakura's</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> head being cut off, do you remember that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"No, I don't know about that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not "I don't remember" or "I forgot." "I don't know."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A slightly odd way to put it.<PG>
Is <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> pretending she never saw the scene, or does she truly not know―
{PAUSE ""}
that is, was it not <STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE> who cut it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Checking this now will not lead to anything constructive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is only that I want to know.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you remember, don't you? That I cut off </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura's</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> head."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's why you never called the police until now, isn't it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I don't know."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"You kept quiet all this time to protect me, didn't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Even now..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... could it be you've realized?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Who really cut off the head."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"At the time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> said this, clear as day: </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">'I pushed </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> off. If things stay like this I'll be suspected as the culprit, so I cut off her head. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That way it can be staged as a baffling murder.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> don't remember that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No, this is the first I've heard of it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Haah... So that's it after all..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Probably. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, have you seen </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah. I just saw her, in fact."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I see... So that's how it is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">So, what will </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> do now?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
