<STYLE ID="6">"What's done can't be undone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If there is real remorse there, I don't intend to blame you further. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But if you're giving up on what comes next, I can't keep quiet either."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"How many have died because of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and me? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">And what is happening today? Is this what </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> wanted?"</STYLE>
