{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="19">　Are </STYLE><STYLE ID="20">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="19"> going to just keep taking it like this!?"</STYLE>
