<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Doesn't it gall you!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Don't you feel pathetic, dancing to the tune of </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> shape!?</STYLE>
