<STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> gripped the nata she had leaned against the rock wall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the first time I had seen <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> hold a weapon outside a ritual.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> are my son. So I want you to stay well, always. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But listen: if you're a man of Arata, settle the score. </STYLE>
